{
  "title": "Portland Bridge Ride",
  "indexDescription": "Portland Bridges bike ride with Garret, Doug, and Jaclyn.",
  "description": "Portland Bridges bike ride with Doug, Jaclyn and Garret.\n\nEvery year you can sign up for the Portland bridge bike ride that traverses several bridges car free.  I did this with with Doug, Jaclyn and Garret on August 11, 2019.\n\nI drove down to Portland and stayed at Garret and Jaclyn’s place. I drove to the ride since my bike rack was big enough for all four of our bikes. \n",
